# AI writing (optional): the deal memo / investment thesis and the opt-in "AI estimate".
# Set ONE of these; the first one set is used, in this order. AI never supplies the
# financials themselves; those come from SEC filings and market data providers.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY: Claude. Key at https://console.anthropic.com (ANTHROPIC_MODEL defaults to claude-opus-5-5)
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_API_KEY: Google Gemini. Key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey (GEMINI_MODEL defaults to gemini-2.5-flash)
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GROQ_API_KEY: Groq. Free key at https://console.groq.com/keys
# Live market data needs no key: financials come from SEC EDGAR (US companies) or
# Yahoo Finance, prices from Finnhub, Yahoo Finance, CNBC or Stooq.
GROQ_API_KEY=

# PORT: optional, defaults to 3000. Hosts like Render set this automatically.
# PORT=3000

# SEC_USER_AGENT: recommended. The SEC asks automated clients to identify themselves
# with a name and contact email, e.g. "Jane Doe jane@example.com".
# SEC_USER_AGENT=

# FINNHUB_API_KEY: recommended on cloud hosts (Render etc.), where Yahoo often blocks
# requests. Used first for US share prices. Free key at https://finnhub.io/register
# FINNHUB_API_KEY=
